note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note tests/physics0/pd1/pd1_run.om: Pure seeded OM-2 PD-1 run harness (Physics-0 Direction 7).
note Reads label-free PD1REC1 stream, verifies SHA-256 chain, splits FIT/SELECT/HOLDOUT,
note drives unchanged PD-0 learner on latency and class views, builds rivals, preregisters
note holdout predictions by SHA-256 before scoring, runs section 6 controls, emits PDLAW1,
note and prints the receipt.

